---
import Figure from './Figure.astro';
import Fig1OperationsPanel from './Fig1OperationsPanel.astro';
---

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="doc">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Custom software &amp; AI automation · Honolulu, Hawaiʻi</div>
        <h1 style="margin:20px 0 22px;max-width:15ch">
          A field guide to the software you already own.
        </h1>
        <p class="lead" style="max-width:54ch">
          Most businesses don’t need another tool. They need the seven they’re already
          paying for to stop being seven separate jobs. We map what you’re running, find
          where the handoffs break, and build the layer that closes them.
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href="#map" class="btn">Get your systems mapped</a>
          <a href="#how" class="btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="side">
        <span class="lbl">In the margin</span>
        Every engagement opens with a system map — yours, drawn from your actual stack,
        before a line of code is written. It’s free, it takes about a week, and it’s yours
        whether or not you hire us.
      </aside>
    </div>

    <Figure caption="Fig. 1 — Operations panel, annotated">
      <Fig1OperationsPanel />
    </Figure>
  </div>
</section>
